","column_from_right":4,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"陵王功曹史安陸南郡二王友入為中書侍郎尋除宣"},{"pdf_page":4,"leaf":"二下","half":"右","column_from_right":5,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"城內史清謹有恩惠郡民張倪吳慶爭田經年不決志"},{"pdf_page":4,"leaf":"二下","half":"右","column_from_right":6,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"到官父老乃相謂曰王府君有德政吾曹鄉里乃有此"},{"pdf_page":4,"leaf":"二下","half":"右","column_from_right":7,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"爭倪慶相攜請罪所訟地遂為閑田徵拜黃門侍郎尋"},{"pdf_page":4,"leaf":"二下","half":"右","column_from_right":8,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"遷吏部侍郎出為寧朔將軍東陽太守郡獄有重囚十"},{"pdf_page":4,"leaf":"二下","half":"右","column_from_right":9,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"餘人冬至日悉遣還家過節皆返惟一人失期獄司以"},{"pdf_page":4,"leaf":"二下","half":"右","column_from_right":10,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"為言志曰此自太守事主者勿憂明旦果自詣獄辭以"},{"pdf_page":4,"leaf":"三上","half":"左","column_from_right":1,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"婦孕吏民益歎服之視事三年齊永明二年入為侍中"},{"pdf_page":4,"leaf":"三上","half":"左","column_from_right":2,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"未拜轉吏部尚書在選以和理稱崔慧景平以例加右"},{"pdf_page":4,"leaf":"三上","half":"左","column_from_right":3,"start":0,"end":17,"text":"軍將軍封臨汝侯固讓不受改領右衛將軍"}]},"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhi-wyd","book_id":"b-liangshu-021","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-021-wangzhi-wyd1739"},{"id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhi:p002","text":"志年九歲，居所生母憂，哀容毀瘠，爲中表所異。弱冠，選尚孝武女安固公主，拜駙馬都尉、秘書郎。累遷太尉行參軍，太子舍人，武陵王文學。褚淵爲司徒，引志爲主簿。淵謂僧虔曰：「朝廷之恩，本爲殊特，所可光榮，在屈賢子。」累遷鎮北竟陵王功曹史、安陸南郡二王友。入爲中書侍郎。尋除宣城內史，清謹有恩惠。郡民張倪、吳慶爭田，經年不決。志到官，父老乃相謂曰：「王府君有德政，吾曹鄉里乃有此爭。」倪、慶因相攜請罪，所訟地遂爲閑田。徵拜黃門侍郎，尋遷吏部侍郎。出爲寧朔將軍、東陽太守。郡獄有重囚十餘人，冬至日悉遣還家，過節皆返，惟一人失期，獄司以爲言。志曰：「此自太守事，主者勿憂。」明旦，果自詣獄，辭以婦孕，吏民益嘆服之。視事三年，齊永明二年，入爲侍中，未拜，轉吏部尚書，在選以和理稱。崔慧景平，以例加右軍將軍，封臨汝侯，固讓不受，改領右衛將軍。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":0,"end":1,"surface":"志","id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhi:p002:m0000","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBC","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作志。"},{"start":17,"end":19,"surface":"中表","id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhi:p002:u0017","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"合稱親戚，未分個人"},{"start":27,"end":29,"surface":"孝武","id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhi:p002:m0027","person_id":"hx8_st4_jdd","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作孝武。"},{"start":30,"end":34,"surface":"安固公主","id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhi:p002:m0030","person_id":"hx8_st4_jdd_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作安固公主。"},{"start":58,"end":61,"surface":"武陵王","id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhi:p002:m0058","person_id":"i1v_ajd_qr0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作武陵王。"},{"start":64,"end":66,"surface":"褚淵","id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhi:p002:m0064","person_id":"jyx_72x_8t2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作褚淵。"},{"start":71,"end":72,"surface":"志","id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhi:p002:m0071","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBC","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作志。"},{"start":76,"end":77,"surface":"淵","id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhi:p002:m0076","person_id":"jyx_72x_8t2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作褚淵。"},{"start":78,"end":80,"surface":"僧虔","id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhi:p002:m0078","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作僧虔。"},{"start":108,"end":111,"surface":"竟陵王","id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhi:p002:m0108","person_id":"x3q_cqm_dup","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作竟陵王。"},{"start":115,"end":117,"surface":"安陸","id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhi:p002:m0115","person_id":"kix_r92_2ed_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作安陸。"},{"start":117,"end":119,"surface":"南郡","id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhi:p002:m0117","person_id":"iop_ybd_afm","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpreta